{"server":"tw","storyId":"act23side_level_act23side_08_end","groupId":"act23side","stageId":"act23side_08","title":"曠古之晤","storyCode":"WB-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"473eeef2b67b7845ced0dbd772a51ed5a7c40f33b35a4c1e77c3455d45469b96","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"尚在那一片混沌鴻蒙之中，我見過兩個頑童大打出手，只為爭搶撿來的一顆果子。\n兩人年紀相仿，身材相仿。只是其中一個反應更快些，掄起的拳頭也更沉些，就將對手打倒在地。\n果子當然也就成了他的戰利品。\n勝者歡欣，敗者垂淚。\n我也見過那場圍獵。\n人類向不可企及的“祂們”宣戰。渺小的個體戰勝了連仰視都目不能及的神明，伏屍百萬，流血漂櫓。\n勝者生存，敗者消亡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第八合。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"面對搶攻，宗師只是撤了一步。槐天裴的拳在挨到宗師手掌邊緣時便已勢盡。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（撐拔骨骼的聲音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第九合......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"槐天裴重拳直取宗師身側，封住其身法退路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗師未動，同出重拳，截槐天裴拳勢之半而擊之......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咳血的聲音）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"我輸了。\n我輸了......？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第......十合。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"錄武官停下了手中的筆。\n他不知道，到底該怎樣記錄這一拳。\n只是極其簡單的對招。兩人從出拳到相擊到分開，沒有任何形意變化，像是孩童為了搶奪吃食出全力衝撞。\n只不過，他們搶奪的，是“勝”。\n他從未見過，老師的臉上閃過忍痛的神情。\n起風了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......宗師勝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（咳血的聲音）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"閣下看起來的確是沒有將勝負放在心上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會不在意勝負？！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你確實是天下第一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我練了四十年，就能勝過你一拳。那我再練三百六十年，就能徹底勝過你！那時我就是天下第一！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是再練三百年，我恐怕的確不是你的對手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可世上真有普通人能達到如此長的壽命嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"的確有些人依託源石技藝來延長壽命，年逾三百的例子並不是沒有......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只可惜，槐先生應該不行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使不等三百年，你也已經是人間第一。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錄武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老師......槐先生已經暈過去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先將他送回軍營療傷吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉門守軍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（此起彼伏的叫好）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉門守軍","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（擊打刀鞘的聲響）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁洵，那個人，是你的朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以你觀之，那把劍能否託付給他？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"論武功人品，再無其他人可以勝任。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太傅","speakerId":"avg_npc_301_1","isRemote":false,"text":"平祟侯覺得如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"左宣遼沒有說話。他看著城樓下的戰場，雙方一倒一立，勝負已分。\n但將士們仍在以刀擊鞘，這是長久以來，玉門軍中觀看演武時特有的助威形式。\n的確是場難得一見的對決，戰場廣闊，飛沙走石，生死相搏。\n病弱的將軍都覺得隱隱血熱。\n曾有多少次，自己和他並肩作戰，無論面對怎樣的敵人，也不過如這般奮力向前。\n如果有一個地方，他可以託付這把劍，那也應該是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天災......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣遼","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要來了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"師父，我回來了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女一步一頓，走向了移動城市航道旁的一處土丘。\n墳塋新起不久，旁邊有幾株對角分佈的胡楊，是她專門選的記號。所幸與自己估算的距離差得不多，城市沒有駛出太遠。\n她躬下身，將劍放在墳頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師父，我說過，我會將這把劍帶回來，我做到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去了那家工坊，見了那個刀匠，也看到了那棵老槐樹......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"移動城市裡面的樣子，和我想像的大不相同......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那樣一個地方，是不是就能算“家”呢？"},{"type":"narration","text":"為什麼人們生活在會移動的巨大地塊上，卻一點都不擔心害怕？\n不害怕天災摧毀房屋，不害怕找不到水源和食物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實，我有些不明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不明白移動城市裡的人，甚至不明白離開移動城市的您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也不明白，他，到底是一個怎樣的人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n聲音很遙遠，是誰在向自己搭話嗎？\n她突然想看看，這到底是怎樣的一把劍。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我會在明天出發。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近期邊境安穩，我離開一陣子，應該也沒事。"},{"type":"narration","text":"這麼著急？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......還有另外一些兄弟的傷病，都等不起了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉門找不到可以醫治的醫生，不代表炎國找不到。就算在炎國找不到，這片大地又何其遼闊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一個弟弟，或許他就有這本事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在我回來之前......你要保重。"},{"type":"narration","text":"你又不是醫生，怎麼這麼霸道。也不問問病人自己想做什麼？\n哪怕我已經時日無多，剩下的時間，我也想去別的地方看看。\n在玉門待了這麼久，眼睛裡都是這望不到頭的黃沙。不如趁我還騎得動馱獸的時候，再到處走走。\n去尚蜀看看聞名遐邇的三山十八峰，去江南嚐嚐剛採的脆生生的菱角......\n最好，能有個人陪著我一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"病人不能太任性......"},{"type":"narration","text":"可是你怎麼會懂病人的心思。其實你從來都不會生病，甚至不會受傷，對嗎？\n不只如此，我們認識了這麼久，你臉頰上一道皺紋都沒有添過。\n我們，是不一樣的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這就出發。你別想那麼多，好好休息......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......夢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"古劍出鞘。\n只是普通的劍，除了造型奇怪了些，甚至都不鋒利。\n透過那幾寸劍身，她看到了天際的雲，和被雲遮住的日影。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一縷殘魂悄然離去。\n他已經得到了答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"師父，我該走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要把劍還回去......我還要，親自問問他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"令小姐，您怎麼睡在甕城頂上！天災馬上就來了，趕緊下來避險吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡就交給我們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"情況如何？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"玉門四衛已經升起，甕城濾沙結構和源石淨化工事也已全部啟動，它們會成為玉門第一道也是最牢固的那道屏障。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但從前方雲團的規模來看，玉門四衛並不足以將風暴全部攔下來，越過屏風衛的沙塵和源石粉塵將形成二次風暴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"估計，仍相當於一場小型天災。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"百姓遷出後，關聯城東的全部地塊已經下沉躲避衝擊。但核心內城的地塊是固定的，它們會直面二次風暴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們有多少人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"駐守玉門的欽天監術師，共十二人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如何分工？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"六人在此堅守，六人保護核心內城。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"內城，六人夠嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"平祟侯有令，兩處都不得有失。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......欽天監當盡全力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們都去核心內城吧，這裡交給我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是一樣危險，別囉嗦。去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"上一回看到類似的景象，還是幾十年前剛到尚蜀的時候。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉門沒有湖松和歸行那樣清冽的佳釀，但烈刀子也是好酒。天呀，你又用這樣的景色招待我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也應該再敬你一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可惜呀，可惜今日手邊無盞可擲。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一聲驚雷像是突然在耳邊炸響，壓住所有人的心跳。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"只一瞬間，黑雲壓城。\n層層疊疊的氣團硬生生把天空拖垮，來回穿梭的弧形閃電像是猙獰的活物。\n雨滴在凝聚的瞬間便已蒸發，空氣乾燥得似乎稍有摩擦便會燃燒起來。\n玉門城便是那枚火石。\n天地只此一景，何等誇張，何等可怖，又是何等壯觀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來得好！"},{"type":"narration","text":"身側的提燈應聲而亮，詩人起身，解開葫蘆滿飲——\n百丈狂沙吹雨，咫尺驚雷連雲。\n當年擲盞飛殘暮，今宵抔酒對高城。\n天地入甕瓶。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍A","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"功率已經開始重新調高了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍B","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍B","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再高！讓沙渠維持在滿功率運轉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍A","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使是在玉門城移速最高的時候，沙渠的排沙壓力也沒這麼大。現在城市靜止，單單滿功率運轉沙渠，沒有聯動裝置分擔，機械損耗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍B","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"顧不上那麼多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍B","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果屏風衛擋下的沙土和源石浮塵全堆積在前面，以這個量，玉門的基座會被“吃掉”，如果陷死，之後就麻煩了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍A","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海眾頭目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕，你們要先考慮考慮自己的麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍A","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這天，是徹底變了臉呀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"荊先生？不是組織大家都到城西避災嗎，你們怎麼還沒走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那幫山海眾的*玉門行話*，趁著混亂，到處破壞天災工事，騷擾老百姓，剛剛被我們撞見了好幾次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是巡防營的工作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是天災又是山海眾，巡防營應付得過來嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說這種時候躲起來，我們還對得起腰上掛的這口刀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩爾貢打扮的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算，算我一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩爾貢兄弟，你只是來玉門旅遊的，犯不著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩爾貢打扮的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"炎國話說，“滴水之恩，湧泉相報”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩爾貢打扮的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總不能，白白讓大家請我喝了那麼多酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好小子，有志氣。行，也算你一個。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別廢話了。沒保護好玉門，左宣遼才會治你的罪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接著。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是新釀的烈刀子！坊主說過，要請你們喝酒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孟老先生他......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多的不必說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要知道他是死在這群*玉門行話*手裡的就夠了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貪婪的山海眾成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些玉門佬，都要逃命了，還是沒忘記把家當搬得乾乾淨淨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貪婪的山海眾成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過這條街還有好幾家玉石鋪子，總不至於連石頭......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的山海眾成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是窮慣了，看見財物就晃了眼吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的山海眾成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那一隊已經去搗毀沙渠了，別忘了我們的任務是什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貪婪的山海眾成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒忘沒忘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貪婪的山海眾成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過他們已經有所準備。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的山海眾成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一群二十年沒真動過刀，只能靠打擂台發洩的老粗......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的山海眾成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏合之眾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怕什麼，一群流寇匪徒出身的傢伙，頂著這麼有文化的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏合之眾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們的目的是到處流竄，盡可能製造混亂，別讓他們跑了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再分出一撥人，截斷旁邊的康慶街，康慶街通向城西，百姓們都在那！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩爾貢打扮的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"交給我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喝完酒，一起殺賊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來的時候不覺得，往回走怎麼......這麼遠......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"風沙也越來越......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還好。足跡沒有完全被抹平......找到你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的確是在返回玉門，你沒有騙我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你為什麼在這裡？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來拿回劍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也來確保你平安無事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼......也傷得這麼重？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來不及說了，要趕緊回到城裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你運氣很好，跳下沙渠竟然沒有喪命。但這身傷，恐怕要治療很久......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我扶你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"截雲","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有什麼事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......可能是我看錯了。這個時候，沙漠裡怎麼可能會有別人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左樂","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"玉門城完全停止行進，與預計地點稍有偏差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"天災主體已經觸及玉門東城，暫時無法與魏公取得聯繫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"影衛","speakerId":"avg_npc_038","isRemote":false,"text":"......登城。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g6_yumengate"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"令小姐真是，好氣勢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"看得我這隻老鼠都有些技癢了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍B","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這幫傢伙，是想關停沙渠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍B","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他們清楚沙渠在此刻的重要性......山海眾裡居然還有精通機械構造的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海眾頭目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（冷哼聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海眾頭目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是要自己轉身跳下去，還是待會我把你們的屍體拋下去？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防營守軍A","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仇姑娘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說左樂來過這裡，想著來幫幫忙。看來我到得剛剛好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海眾頭目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海眾頭目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"山海眾曾經向姜齊的水寨發出過邀請，可惜還沒收到回覆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海眾頭目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而你現在居然和炎國官軍站在一起，未免太可笑了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們的消息，很靈通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海眾頭目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。我們一直在關注著同路人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"囉嗦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"山海眾頭目","speakerId":"avg_npc_793_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道忘了自己來玉門，是為了報仇？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好問題，可惜我已經有答案了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"劍客重新舉起了手中的武器。\n這一擊，她不再有收劍的理由。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g1_yumenstreet_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"來自薩爾貢的男人劈出一刀，擊退了偷襲守軍的山海眾成員。\n他的炎國話不標準，但這一刀俐落瀟灑又威力極大，頗有返璞歸真的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......好快的刀！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好傢伙，原來你之前在客棧不是吹的，你是真有兩下子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩爾貢打扮的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我，沒兩下子，我就這一下子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩爾貢打扮的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位宗師當年遊歷到薩爾貢，確實教過我，但只教了這一招......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"砍了他們這麼多人，這幫傢伙還不退，也真是不怕死。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"薩爾貢打扮的遊客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼回事......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是風暴撞在屏風衛上的動靜，大家小心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的震感，比以往玉門經歷的任何一次天災都要來得強烈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫長","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢想直面天災的欽天監術師們怎麼樣了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的山海眾成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"現在是天災最猛烈的時候，他們疲於應付，我們別在這裡耗著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷酷的山海眾成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"快點解決這些人，然後往城西的居民避難點撤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貪婪的山海眾成員","speakerId":"avg_npc_794_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鬧了就想溜？早就猜到你們要往這個方向衝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當兵的，快把他們圍起來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"荊先生","speakerId":"avg_npc_799_1","isRemote":false,"text":"天災有欽天監術師們收拾，那這幫臭*玉門行話*就由我們收拾！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"天裂了個口，數不清的沙礫和石塊在旋渦中摩擦、翻滾、碰撞，竟然發出金屬般的刺耳聲響。\n風暴旋轉著直衝到城樓，而後撞上了一堵由源石技藝組成的牆。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"擋住！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"重新列陣！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣的衝擊力，真的只是越過屏風衛後的二次風暴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"林先生，您怎麼來了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"來搭把手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡有我們在，您老人家回去吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"回哪去？這樣的動靜，未必老人家還能安心在房間裡睡午覺。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"內城的源石淨化裝置能勉強吸附源石浮塵不至於擴散，但塵暴本身的衝擊，只能靠術師們的源石技藝了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"多個人，多份力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"林說著話，邁步向前。\n他不知道什麼時候脫下了外套。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"操弄了幾十年的沙子，要是這種時候再派不上一點用場，我這把老骨頭還真不如就地埋了算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說，各位天師嫌棄我這點法術不夠用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......林先生小心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"變陣！給林先生讓個位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"這就對了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸！我追了你一路......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞，你來得正好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你才剛剛受過傷！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"會礙事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"看好了，源石技藝，你還有的是東西要學。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"風暴在半空重新聚攏，轉瞬再至。最外圍的土石雜屑無序旋轉，風暴的中心，空氣被壓縮到極致，隱隱有火星迸射。\n天地作長吼，隨後在下一瞬間突然靜音——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"平地起黃沙。沙粒填補了源石技藝牆的每一寸縫隙，推著它緩慢但是穩穩地向前，一米......三米......十米！\n林站在術師們中間。再大的風也吹不動百年的樹。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"我等從未見過這樣的沙石法術......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"全力施展，能將輻射範圍擴大到這樣的程度，還如此穩定......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"當心，又來了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"林雨霞其實沒有見過父親全力施展源石技藝的樣子。他處理敵人，從來用不著大張旗鼓。\n作為龍門的影子，他的生活很有規律——\n在大街小巷“閒逛”，喝一碗鱗丸湯，見一些人，活著的，死了的。\n多數時間談笑風生，能讓他齜牙咧嘴的事情，已然不多。\n可此刻脫了那件外套，他的背影看上去瘦小得有些誇張。林雨霞清楚地看見他施術的手臂開始打顫，像是隨時會被風吹折的，枯枝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"扶林先生下去......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"四波源石塵暴，林先生在法陣中心，分擔了大半的衝擊，已經吃不消了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"（咳血的聲音）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"唉......\n“但願這次能早些了事，不耽誤你去維多利亞的行程。”\n“沒見過另一條路，就不能算自己的選擇。”\n爸總是說這樣的話。\n林雨霞該走什麼樣的路，不希望父親來安排，可能她自己也還沒有想好。\n但爸他，其實早就老了，那句經常掛在嘴邊的“退休”不是開開玩笑。\n上陣父女，老一輩的倒下來，小一輩的就得頂上去。\n從來都是這麼個不講道理的道理。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"林雨霞上前了一步，將受傷的父親擋在身後，頂替了他的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"欽天監術師","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雨霞姑娘......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別多說，你們都受了傷，調整呼吸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這幾波了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看前面！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
